---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Green Dragon"
letter: "G"
anchor: "green-dragon"
category: "edibles"
---

A cannabis tincture made by soaking decarboxylated cannabis in high-proof grain alcohol at room temperature for 24 hours or more. The longer soak extracts more cannabinoids but also more chlorophyll and plant material, resulting in a darker, greener, more cannabis-forward tincture. Higher potency than Golden Dragon; stronger flavour. Best for cooking applications where the cannabis taste is masked by other ingredients.

→ [How to Make Cannabis Tincture](/edibles/how-to-make-cannabis-tincture-green-golden-dragon/)
